{"version":1,"content":"<p>由英國IWGB遊戲工作者工會、愛爾蘭遊戲工作者聯盟（Game Workers Unite Ireland）、CSVI以及意大利米蘭FIOM-CGIL工作委員會等多個歐洲遊戲行業組織組成的聯盟，近日聯合發佈一份全新宣言，公開反對生成式人工智能（GenAI）在電子遊戲開發中的廣泛應用。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587068.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T05:24:04.098617+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T05:16:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T05:17:14.627081+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T05:17:14.627081+00:00","content_hash":"e20419e7b7cbf8a68ba6b09bc47eb013015eec7e968425a79e65c832eb2b5462","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}